comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-26T03:05:50.655Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check evidence: searched all statuses for published package bins, executable coverage, pm-mcp-http, verifier, and release recovery. pm-u0oz2k is the closed predecessor that created the fail-closed package-derived coverage rule; pm-ygli86 is the open released-artifact parent; pm-55yf1t is the aggregate MCP release gate. None implements semantic execution coverage for the newly declared HTTP bin or owns this v2026.8.26 recovery defect."
  "2026-08-26T03:37:38.868Z","harness:codex","Evidence: the original tag-push Release run 32923834092 published npm version 2026.8.26 but stopped before installed-agent acceptance and GitHub Release creation because pm-mcp-http was not represented in the verifier coverage map. The immutable registry artifact is executable and healthy. The repaired verifier passed the tracker-linked focused suite (27/27), live exact-public-package verification under npx and bunx including HTTP 200 MCP 2026-07-28 server/discover, and full repository coverage (581 files, 7,994 tests, 100% statements/branches/functions/lines: 59,152/44,529/12,307/56,976). CODEFACTOR_BASE_REF=origin/main pnpm lint also passed ESLint, zero duplication, build/contracts, repository static quality, package/SDK/surface/grammar/flag/refusal gates, MCP deprecation inventory with zero canonical violations, tracker context quality, graph composition, and record integrity."
  "2026-08-26T03:47:54.533Z","harness:codex","Hosted review remediation: CodeRabbit exact-head review on PR #1121 identified two blocking lifecycle/budget defects. The HTTP verifier now caps startup to two 20-second attempts per executor, keeping the added worst-case budget at 100 seconds within the eight-minute hosted step. The evaluator installs SIGINT/SIGTERM handlers and performs bounded process-group SIGTERM then SIGKILL cleanup. Focused verification is 29/29, including a real forced outer-timeout control with an intentionally SIGTERM-resistant detached runner and proof that its loopback port is immediately reusable. Live immutable npm 2026.8.26 verification remains green for npx and bunx pm-mcp-http HTTP 200 discovery."
